      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "MediaPipe hand-pose estimation (cv2.dnn), two stages.\n\nStage 1 'CV MediaPipe Palm Detect' runs the palm SSD (palm_detection_mediapipe_2023feb.onnx) and outputs one box + 7 palm landmarks per hand, packed as the (N, 19) 'palms' array. Stage 2 'CV MediaPipe Hand Pose' takes that 'palms' array plus the SAME image and regresses the 21 hand keypoints per hand (handpose_estimation_mediapipe_2023feb_int8bq.onnx). Put both .onnx files in ComfyUI/models/onnx and pick them in the model combos.\n\nEverything downstream is visualization, kept in separate nodes: the hand box goes to core 'Draw BBoxes'; then 'CV Draw Connections' draws the skeleton from the 'landmarks' + 'connections' (the MediaPipe HAND_CONNECTIONS edges); 'CV Draw Points' marks the 21 keypoints; 'CV Draw Labels' names them from 'keypoint_names'. Zero palms / zero hands is a valid result (empty outputs). Gesture naming is NOT baked in: build it as a subgraph over the landmarks."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
